## Toggle (disable without unwiring)
In `index.html`, CHEM-WIRE block: set `const CHEM_CONDITION = false;`.
Conversion then behaves exactly as before this wiring (the helper becomes
a pass-through). The chemmark stamps still exist in the MathML but are
inert attributes; nothing reads them.

