## Scope decisions
- HTML/EPUB path ONLY. The OMML/Word path (`conditionForOmml` +
  `rewriteIsotopes`) is deliberately untouched: chemistry conditioning
  targets screen-reader markup, and the standing chemistry A/B rule says
  no document-level chemistry change ships to a new surface untested.
- Runtime A arrow remap (queued, unimplemented): when built, it must run
  AFTER chemCond and target only accessibility serializations
  (aria-label + hidden MathML), never the visual tree.

